# The benchmark (docs/BACKLOG.md, SG-5; src/game/bench.h): built with BENCH 1 (the "bench" line),
# it boots on foot and goes round its views with no pad, counting the frames each misses, then
# turns the screen green (pass) or red (fail) with a line a view. The film just waits for that:
# run_e2e.ps1 exits 0 on a pass, 2 on a fail, 3 if no verdict came (bench_verdict.png has the lines)
bench
wait_up
wait 5
shot bench_00_running
wait_verdict 420
